== [    BASIC ] ============================================================================================
   MNEMONIC: rdmsr [ENC: EVEX, MAP: MAP7, OPC: 0xF6]
     LENGTH: 10
        SSZ: 64
       EOSZ: 32
       EASZ: 64
   CATEGORY: SYSTEM
    ISA-SET: APX_F_MSR_IMM
    ISA-EXT: APXEVEX
 EXCEPTIONS: MSR_IMM_EVEX
 ATTRIBUTES: HAS_MODRM HAS_EVEX IS_PRIVILEGED HAS_EEVEX 
  OPTIMIZED: 62 F7 7F 08 F6 C3 78 56 34 12 

