 0   REGISTER    EXPLICIT       W      MODRM_RM     64      1      64      UINT                          rbx
 1  IMMEDIATE    EXPLICIT       R        UIMM32     32      1      32       INT  [U A 32] 0x0000000012345678
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------

